{"parse": {"title": "12TH-14", "pageid": 127799, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-13\" title=\"12TH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-15\" title=\"12TH-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.9C.E5.BE.81.E5.89.8D.E5.A4.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"远征前夜\">远征前夜</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 远征前夜</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Night Before War</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-bottom: -5px;\"><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"1/220131\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E7%81%AB%E5%BD%92%E4%B8%80\" title=\"万火归一\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E7%81%AB%E5%BD%92%E4%B8%80\" title=\"万火归一\"><img alt=\"万火归一\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Item-220131.png/100px-Item-220131.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Item-220131.png/150px-Item-220131.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Item-220131.png/200px-Item-220131.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">1</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>战<span class=\"color-value\"></span>争<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>火<span class=\"color-value\"></span>光<span class=\"color-value\"></span>步<span class=\"color-value\"></span>步<span class=\"color-value\"></span>紧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>逼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>顿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>河<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>女<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>团<span class=\"color-value\"></span>结<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11214</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_3_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_3_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_3_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十四行诗推门而出。午后的风从草原深处吹来，带着不合时宜的干热。她站住脚，望着那片广袤无垠的草原与天交际处的地平线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风拂过橘色的长发。行程紧迫的疲惫、大战在即的肃穆与因责任感而紧绷的神经，难得地得到了舒缓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>十四行诗小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……伊戈尔先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>见面的礼节十分生硬。这不妨碍硬朗的老将军背靠在不远处的树下，闭着眼睛聆听着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从什么时候开始站在那儿的？十四行诗将这个疑问吞入腹中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你在做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我在听风拂过草地的声音，它像一种启示，能够在战争开始前平复我的心情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手凝神感受着风经过的声音。半晌后，她才继续提问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你是来找司辰的，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>她还在休息？看来那里面的东西给她带来了不小的冲击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>考虑到眼前这位老人的特殊身份，十四行诗藏在身后的手握紧了术杖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>别太紧绷着神经，年轻人。我没有别的意思，只是希望和司辰谈一谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>现在，我们是同一个阵营的盟友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马靴踩过草地的声音从身后传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……在击败格鲁托夫前，我们暂时是盟友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>是我有失考量，我没想到你留在琥珀屋里的时间会这么长。格鲁托夫的军队进攻时，我不得不去指挥军队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这没什么，你有你的责任，我也有面对风险的准备。十四行诗和玛尔纱留下来帮助了我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我想知道，你在琥珀屋中看到了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>开门见山的提问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自亘古而来的恐惧没由来地侵袭了视野，几次深呼吸后，理智才稍稍从角落挤了回来。</div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">兀尔德</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">一场实验</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"3\">纯白的房间</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我见到了兀尔德，可她对自己的身份存有疑虑，而有一些声音坚持让她相信自己就是兀尔德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>她经历了一场残酷的实验。在一个瞬间，她看到了我、认出了我，来到了我面前，之后又消失不见。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我似乎经历了一场实验。不过，真正经历它的不是我，而是……兀尔德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这场实验重复了很多次，每一次都会给她带去巨大的痛苦。这一切似乎都是为了把她转变为另外一个人。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"3\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我看见了一间纯白的房间，我从没见过那样的白色。兀尔德……她就坐在白色房间中的一把椅子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>之后，她在椅子上痛苦地挣扎。我想要帮助她，但什么也做不到。我们之间隔着一层打不破的东西。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我还看见了很多……但都是一些我不能完全理解的画面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>画面？我还以为他们撤离时把屏幕设备都搬走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不，不是影像资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>有些事还没弄明白，我想要再回一次琥珀屋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔沉吟片刻，摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我不建议你这么做，别列格勒城内的巷战还在继续，哪一方都无法保证能长时间控制那座修道院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>骑兵军准备发动野战，红弩箭中尉还在外执行拔除术阵节点的任务，除了你的助手外，分不出任何人手保护你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>司辰对重塑之手有特殊的意义——如果被他们发现你出现在别列格勒，他们一定会想尽办法劫持你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我不希望我和伊万的作战计划节外生枝。所以你必须待在安全的后方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我不否认你的能力与忠诚，十四行诗小姐。但昨天的空袭宣告着别列格勒已经成了真正的战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我明白了，在格鲁托夫被击败后，我会在琥珀屋等你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>战事很快就会结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不久前有士兵找到了我，拜托我送信给他仍在西线的兄弟，他觉得基金会成员的生还概率更高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你写信了吗，伊戈尔先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方难以察觉地叹了口气，似乎有些难言之隐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>如果你死在别列格勒，会有人很遗憾的——她原本打算亲手杀死你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔揉了揉太阳穴，露出一个无可奈何的苦笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>洛佩拉？她还在基金会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>当然。芝诺对她的审查还没有结束，她暂时没法作为士兵参加任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔点了点头，以示意自己希望听到更多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>她在基金会过得还不错，交到了一些新朋友，也因为出老千为自己惹出了一些麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>基金会为她指派了一位“指导员”，以约束她对骰子游戏的沉迷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……很有洛佩拉的风格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>作为信息交换，我也希望你解答我的一个疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>请问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>军长曾邀请我去他家做客，红柳树村的一位夫人招待了我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他说那是他的“母亲”，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>她确实是伊万的母亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>军长替她申请了“暴雨”庇护？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>在找到这位夫人后，没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔双手环胸，皱起了眉头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>谁都没有预料到第一场“暴雨”的到来，哪怕是最有经验的占卜师。伊万的母亲和世界上绝大多数人一样，被第一场“暴雨”回溯了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但伊万找到这位夫人的时候，他和我说，他的“母亲”幸存了下来。他绝不会认错那些深壑般的皱纹，那张慈祥的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>伊万笃定这就是他的母亲。无论“暴雨”是什么，它都奇迹般地没有夺走他们的家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>身为司辰的你，应该知道这件事有多荒谬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个似曾相识的巧合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>终有一天我会弄清楚“真相”，为了所有人，还有……我的母亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔并未回应，而是以深邃的目光注视着草原上的波浪。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜幕降临于草原。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在嘈杂的马蹄声与呼喊声中，斯捷尔诺娃掀开了行营的门帘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>上校，行军要开始了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>是的，骑兵军集结完毕，即将开始夜行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>狮鹫军已经提前启程。三支防空小队已经驻扎在别列格勒，剩下的人正在前往城市北翼的维尔霍罗德岭一带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>伊戈尔也和自己的军队一起去了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>这倒没有，行动的总指挥部还设在塞契，他和军长都在营帐里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>红弩箭中尉提醒我回来检查你是不是还在——听说你很擅长偷偷溜走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身后传来十四行诗的一声憋笑，然后她贴心地帮忙转移了话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>守护城市的只有三支防空小队吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>还有民兵。伊戈尔的人手不够多，骑兵军也不擅长争夺街道，城内的巷战只能依靠民兵了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帐外的躁动愈演愈烈，已经可以从骑兵军的喧哗声中隐约听见军长吼出的号令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>司辰，如果你现在不离开顿河，那就请一定留在安全的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>我得走了，战前动员马上开始。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隐秘而热烈的氛围笼罩在夜空之下，血液中崇武的基因正不安地躁动着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>没想到我竟然能有幸参与一场真正的战争……该死，我的手竟然在发抖！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>傻子！我警告你，不要对战争抱有浪漫的幻想，它会害死你的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>年轻的时候，我们连的那几个同乡的战友，老是幻想着打完胜仗后回到顿河，享受同乡的赞美，与家人团聚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>他们全死了，只有我活到了今天。我回村里给他们上了坟，祈祷他们在战场上庇佑我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>……我也回去了。我去见了我喜欢的姑娘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>你小子不会是说了什么打赢就回家结婚的鬼话吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>不，我什么也没说……我只是看着她的眼睛，她就明白了我的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>我们都知道，这可能就是最后一面了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>……得了，闭嘴吧，军长要说话了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>全军听令，清点人马！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_18\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Cg-3_3_bg_18.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Cg-3_3_bg_18.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Cg-3_3_bg_18.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雄浑而整齐的列阵声震耳欲聋，马儿们迎合着巨响，用蹄子敲响大地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>申请返乡的士兵们全员归队，军长。我就知道，骑兵军没有一个懦夫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我从没有为这件事担心过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>——士兵们，想必你们都已经见识过格鲁托夫和他手下匪军的所作所为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这些黑心肠的懦夫，以为有了偷来的武器，就能肆意践踏哥萨克的家园，杀害哥萨克的亲人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>那是个大言不惭的小丑！我要把他的脑袋挂在后院的树上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻气盛的声音引来了一阵哄笑，随之而来的是无数扬起的拳头，以及无数赞同的呵声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你们看见了——黑色的军队掠夺了我们的亲人、同胞、粮食、土地，乃至尊严。尸体在河畔堆积成山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你们听见了——他们像豺狼一样等待夜色，把孩子们的哭声当成酒后的欢歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>可是，同胞们，他们遇上的是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>是我们，是骑兵军，是草原的战马，是喝着顿河的水长大的儿女，是人民最后的仰仗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我们要用一场胜利彻底把他们打垮。为了草原，为了顿河，为了还未出世的孩子们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>扬起马蹄，冲吧！冲垮敌人的阵线，把他们赶出我们的草原！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众士兵：</div><div>冲啊！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_10\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_3_at_10.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_3_at_10.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_3_at_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这片属于哥萨克人的大地正为它儿女们的士气所颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_10\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_3_at_10.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_3_at_10.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_3_at_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着军长的号令，骑兵的阵列开始移动。排头的侦察兵们高高地举起了火把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>万火归一的士气，让历史的帷幕熊熊燃起。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-14"}}